          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndoda, khangela ngasentabeni yaseSeyiri, utshumayele ngayo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uthi kuyo: INkosi uNkulunkulu ithi: Ngimelene lawe, wena ntaba yaseSeyiri, ngizakukuphakamisela isandla sami, ngikuchithe ube yinkangala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngizachitha imizi yakho, uzakuba yinkangala; uzakwazi ukuba ngiyiNkosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngoba waba lenzondo engapheliyo, wanikela abantu bakoIsrayeli ekubulaweni ngesikhathi sokuhlupheka kwabo, ngesikhathi sokutshaywa kwabo kokucina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngalokho, kutsho uNkulunkulu, ngiyazifunga mina ukuthi ngizakukunikela ekuchithekeni kwegazi, ukuchitheka kwegazi kuthomane lawe; ngoba ulecala lokuchitha igazi, ukuchitheka kwegazi kuzathomana lawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngizachitha intaba yaseSeyiri ibe yinkangala, ngiqede kiyo bonke abafikayo labasukayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngizagcwalisa intaba zakho ngababuleweyo; ababuleweyo empini bazawela emaqaqeni akho lasezihotsheni zakho lasezindongeni zakho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngizakukwenza ube yinkangala engelakuphela, kungahlali muntu emizini yakho. Ng’khona uzakwazi ukuba ngiyiNkosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngoba utshilo wathi: Lezizizwe ezimbili, oJuda loIsrayeli, lamazwe azo kuzakuba ngokwami, sizahlala kukho, lapho iNkosi yayihlala khona; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ngalokho ngiyazifunga, kutsho iNkosi uNkulunkulu, ngizakukuphatha ngokufanele ukuzonda kwakho lomona wakho owawenzayo ngenxa yokubazonda kwakho; ngizakwenza ukuba ungazi nxa ngikuthonisisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uzakwazi ukuba mina Nkosi ngizwile ukuthuka kwakho owakutsho ngezintaba zakoIsrayeli usithi: Zichithekile, zinikiwe thina ukuba sizidle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakhuluma kubi ngami, landisa amazwi enu ngami, ngikuzwile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi uNkulunkulu ithi: Ukuze umhlaba wonke uthokoze, ngizalichitha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Njengoba lathokoza ngelizwe lami uIsrayeli ngoba lachitheka, ngizakwenza njalo kuwe, uzachitheka, wena ntaba yaseSeyiri, lalo lonke iEdoma. Ng’khona bazakwazi ukuba ngiyiNkosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
